{"id":"15425ce9f60b808b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-center.md","title":"Center","display":"df-center — Center","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-center","aliases":["93-df-center"],"display":"df-center — Center","depends_on":["[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","[[93-df-centroid]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-center"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-center</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-center — Center"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6dfa3af0b7ff312\" href=\"?note=f6dfa3af0b7ff312\" title=\"93-df-centroid\">93-df-centroid</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\\)</span> is a bounded lattice.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\)</span> is the set of complemented neutral elements defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f6dfa3af0b7ff312\" href=\"?note=f6dfa3af0b7ff312\" title=\"93-df-centroid\">93-df-centroid</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}\\)</span> is its descriptive alias.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\)</span>；此为中心函数的定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center}\\vdash\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center}\\vdash\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The lattice center is not the common fixed-point set of lattice endomorphisms; its elements are precisely the complemented neutral elements.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-centroid","status":"resolved","id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-centroid]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-centroid","status":"resolved","id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)$ is the set of complemented neutral elements defined in [[93-df-centroid]], and $\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}$ is its descriptive alias.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)$；此为中心函数的定义域，$\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}$ 来自 [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center}\\vdash\\mathrm{Ctr}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)","display":true}],"bytes":930,"backlinks":[{"id":"d4635c6e179ddf8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"This center is the greatest central congruence, not the element-valued lattice center of [[93-df-center]]. The maximality clause is part of the theorem rather than hidden in an undefined local predicate."}],"outgoing":["0454a0272a142daa","f6dfa3af0b7ff312"]}